<http://data.silknow.org/object/590932f6-8175-32a9-827d-6e369c4a174e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "1800s, Persian"@en , "block printed, plain weave cotton, probably hand woven, lined and faced.\nA small purse made from two rectangles of printed cotton, cut on the cross [bias cut] and sewn to form a square envelope with a pointed flap. Cream ground with red feathery stems forming an ogival lattice enclosing a flowering stem in blue, red and mauve.  Lined with the same fabric and faced with bias-cut black, plain weave silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/b0af2353-ba6e-35da-a9a4-e4fbd8f32770> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "1800s, Persian"@en , "block printed, plain weave cotton, probably hand woven, lined and faced.\nA small purse made from two rectangles of printed cotton, cut on the cross [bias cut] and sewn to form a square envelope with a pointed flap. Cream ground with red feathery stems forming an ogival lattice enclosing a flowering stem in blue, red and mauve.  Lined with the same fabric and faced with bias-cut black, plain weave silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/590932f6-8175-32a9-827d-6e369c4a174e/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/590932f6-8175-32a9-827d-6e369c4a174e/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/590932f6-8175-32a9-827d-6e369c4a174e/dimension/2> ;
