<http://data.silknow.org/event/49a12856-fc24-32b5-91e7-51bd028b7bc5>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Donated to the V&A by Robert Murdoch Smith in 1883, together with a batch of sixty-four other printed cotton specimens from Isfahan, and four carpet fragments: \"The [cottons] I got from the calico printers at Ispahan, most of them at least. I have a good many specimens of &lt;i&gt;old&lt;/i&gt; printing.\""@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/590932f6-8175-32a9-827d-6e369c4a174e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Donated to the V&A by Robert Murdoch Smith in 1883, together with a batch of sixty-four other printed cotton specimens from Isfahan, and four carpet fragments: \"The [cottons] I got from the calico printers at Ispahan, most of them at least. I have a good many specimens of &lt;i&gt;old&lt;/i&gt; printing.\""@en .
